# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for MaBoSS.
#
# As with lsan.supp, entries here would be KNOWN pre-existing findings, listed
# so that the sanitizer job can halt on any *new* undefined behaviour. Delete
# each entry as the issue behind it is fixed.
#
# Use it with:
#     UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=engine/tests/sanitizers/ubsan.supp:halt_on_error=1
#
# There are currently no entries: the unit and regression tests are free of
# undefined behaviour. (The last one, signed overflow in GLibCRandomGenerator's
# feedback register, was fixed by doing that arithmetic in uint32_t.)
